    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Later text lists the mortal line from rank one to rank five as green copper, red steel, white silver, yellow gold, and purple crystal Relic Gu, and states that Relic Gu are mortal Gu with no rank six or higher Immortal Gu form. Green copper, red steel, and white silver Relic Gu are widely sold; yellow gold and purple crystal Relic Gu are tightly controlled in the mortal market.",
        "chapters": [
          469
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "series-limits",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_purple_crystal_relic_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_green"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a thumb-sized sphere that gives off a white silvery glow.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s later copy looks like a finger-sized round pearl of white silver color.",
        "chapters": [
          312
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later text again calls Relic Gu a sphere-shaped mortal Gu, thumb-sized, with an ordinary appearance.",
        "chapters": [
          1796
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_relic_gu",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the treehouse display it is a thumb-sized sphere held in a stump’s branches, giving off a white silvery glow.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s later copy looks like a finger-sized round pearl of white silver color.",
        "chapters": [
          312
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is the rank three member of the Relic Gu series: rank one green copper, rank two red steel, rank three white silver (also called Silver Relic Gu in Chapter 111), and rank four yellow golden Relic Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_yellow_gold_relic_gu"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It can be used only once. That single use instantly raises a rank three Gu Master’s cultivation by a small realm.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s activation floods the aperture walls with light, and about four hours later he has moved from rank three upper stage to rank three peak stage. Relic Gu give a stable foundation and do not leave side-effects.",
        "chapters": [
          312
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Shang clan city he spends eighty-three thousand primeval stones in total for a white silver Relic Gu and a golden shield Gu, then holds the Relic Gu unused until he is ready.",
        "chapters": [
          296
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_golden_shield_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He activates it after reaching rank three upper stage so he can jump to rank three peak without repeating the stone aperture Gu method he used in his first life on Qing Mao Mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          312
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_stone_aperture_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In treasure yellow heaven he buys green copper, red steel, white silver, and yellow gold Relic Gu to push a newly formed second aperture upward without ordinary cultivation time. After testing the white silver copy, he activates it and brings that second aperture to rank three peak stage.",
        "chapters": [
          493
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-aperture-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
